{"t": 1787781957.04, "op": "feedback", "id": 1, "helped": true, "outcome": 0.8, "note": "Stub workaround was needed again (VersionRequirementError 5.0) and worked. One correction: the alabaster stub's get_path() must return the PARENT of the real alabaster dir (site-packages), since sphinx theming looks for <get_path()>/alabaster; returning the alabaster dir itself gives FileNotFoundError '.../alabaster/alabaster'.", "access_recorded": true, "value": 0.9386, "outcomes": 18}
