{"t": 1787782225.113, "op": "feedback", "id": 1, "helped": true, "outcome": 1.0, "note": "Recipe directly guided shadowing sphinxcontrib.* and alabaster for a Sphinx 3.0.x checkout on a newer venv; tests went from 25 errors to 28 passed. One gap: a `sphinxcontrib_jsmath-*-nspkg.pth` in site-packages pre-registers `sphinxcontrib` in sys.modules as a namespace package at startup, so a regular stub package on PYTHONPATH is never consulted. Fix was a `sitecustomize.py` in the stubs dir doing `sys.modules.pop('sphinxcontrib', None)`. Also: alabaster stub needs `__path__.append(<real dir>)` because theme.conf references `alabaster.support`.", "access_recorded": true, "value": 0.9986, "outcomes": 18}
