{"t": 1787783065.736, "op": "feedback", "id": 1, "helped": true, "outcome": 0.7, "note": "Recipe was the right direction and step (4) (extend stub __path__ to real pkg dir) was exactly needed for alabaster.support. Gap: a sphinxcontrib_*-nspkg.pth pre-seeds sys.modules['sphinxcontrib'] with a site-packages-only __path__, so a stub sphinxcontrib/ package on PYTHONPATH is silently bypassed; needed a stubs/sitecustomize.py that prepends the stubs dir to the pre-seeded __path__. Also alabaster (top-level, not sphinxcontrib) is loaded unconditionally by sphinx 3.x application.py and needs a stub with get_path() proxy.", "access_recorded": true, "value": 0.9086, "outcomes": 18}
